For maintenance dosing, use:

\[
\text{Dose}=\frac{C_{\text{target}}\times CL\times \tau}{F}
\]

Clearance is:

\[
CL=\frac{0.693\times V_d}{t_{1/2}}
=\frac{0.693\times14.3}{2}\approx4.95\text{ L/h}
\]

Thus, for an 8-hour interval:

\[
\text{Dose}=\frac{15\text{ mg/L}\times4.95\text{ L/h}\times8\text{ h}}{0.50}
\approx1{,}189\text{ mg}
\]

The closest option is 1200 mg. The Blackboard provides no additional clinical findings or medication/allergy information that changes this calculation.

FINAL ANSWER: C
